---
import { FINANCE_RADAR } from "../data/finance-radar";
---

<section class="radar" aria-labelledby="market-radar-title">
  <header class="radar__head">
    <div>
      <p class="radar__eyebrow">SOURCE FEED</p>
      <h2 id="market-radar-title">시장 레이더</h2>
    </div>
    <p>공식 원문을 빠르게 훑는 보조 피드</p>
  </header>
  <ol class="radar__list">
    {FINANCE_RADAR.map((item) => (
      <li>
        <time datetime={item.date}>{item.date.slice(5).replace("-", ".")}</time>
        <span class="radar__topic">{item.topic}</span>
        <a href={item.postHref}>{item.title}</a>
        <span class="radar__signal">{item.signal}</span>
        <a class="radar__source" href={item.postHref}>{item.source} 해설 →</a>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="radar__note">목록은 사실 확인을 위한 원문 피드이며, 주요 이슈는 아래 독립 해설 포스트로 발행합니다.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .radar { margin: var(--space-5) 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .radar__head { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-3); }
  .radar__head h2 { margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .radar__head > p { margin: 0; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .82rem; }
  .radar__eyebrow { margin: 0; color: var(--accent); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .radar__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .radar__list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 64px minmax(160px, 1.2fr) minmax(170px, 1fr) 88px; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); min-height: 52px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); font-size: .84rem; }
  .radar time, .radar__source { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .76rem; }
  .radar__topic { color: var(--accent); font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .radar a { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .radar a:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .radar__signal { color: var(--fg-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .radar__source { color: var(--accent); text-align: right; text-decoration: none; }
  .radar__note { margin: 0; padding: var(--space-3) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .76rem; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .radar__head > p { display: none; }
    .radar__list li { grid-template-columns: 48px 58px minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 10px 0; }
    .radar__signal { grid-column: 3; }
    .radar__source { display: none; }
  }
</style>
